---

**Summary:**
You’ve added new towers, game modes, and a huge variety of monsters to Old War Defense, overhauled the visuals of your puzzle and action minigames for a mystical/arcane feel, and improved UI/UX across the board. The Diapered Defenders: VR Module received a full handbook-themed overhaul with puzzle gating, spawn rules, and token layering fixes. Every minigame now has a distinct, polished look and unique gameplay features!

---

## App-Wide Improvements & New Features

- **Unified Visual Theme:**
  - All minigames and UI panels now use a consistent mystical/arcane style with gold, black, and deep jewel tones for a cohesive experience.
  - Elegant serif and display fonts (Cinzel, Cormorant Garamond, EB Garamond, Old Standard TT) used throughout for a magical, ancient feel.

- **Navigation & Layout:**
  - Improved navigation between minigames and handbooks.
  - Responsive layouts for desktop and mobile, with touch controls where appropriate.
  - Game containers and info panels now have matching gold-lined borders and subtle glows.

- **Handbook & Reference Data:**
  - Expanded bestiary, item, and race data with new entries and improved formatting.
  - Added new PDF and HTML handbook documents to the reference library.
  - Enhanced search and quick-jump features for handbook content.

- **Performance & Accessibility:**
  - Faster load times and optimized asset delivery for all games and handbooks.
  - Improved keyboard navigation and ARIA labels for accessibility.
  - All interactive elements have larger hitboxes and clearer focus states.

- **Quality of Life:**
  - Message and notification system standardized across all games.
  - All important game events and errors now appear in styled message boxes below the main play area.
  - Added tooltips and help text to buttons and controls.

- **Assets & Data Pipeline:**
  - Migrated many monster sprites from PNG to WebP for faster loading; removed superseded PNGs.
  - Large batch of new item/resource images added and optimized.
  - Boardgame token sets refreshed (Cleric, Fighter, Monk, Ranger, Rogue, Wizard).
  - Added .gitignore and asset housekeeping.

- **Start Scripts & Dev:**
  - Windows helpers for local runs: start_server.bat, start_server_powershell.bat, start_tower_defense.bat, start_handbook.bat.

- **Content Expansion:**
  - New lore entries, event generators, and random tables for worldbuilding.
  - Additional boardgame modules and minigame variants added to the app.
  - More backgrounds, images, and audio assets for richer immersion.

---

## Granular Feature & Content Additions

### Bestiary & Reference (Detailed)
- Runtime bestiary integration:
  - src/data/monsters-runtime.js (runtime loader/utilities)
  - src/data/Diaper-School-Full-Bestiary.json (dataset)
  - src/Main-Bestiary.json (compiled/reference)
- bestiary.html: updated to support richer cards and runtime-backed rollable actions.

### Assets & Media (Detailed)
- Monsters: Converted many PNGs to WebP (Brackling, Darkforme variants, Darkling variants, etc.); removed redundant PNGs.
- Items/Resources: Added numerous new PNGs (ores, essences, herbs, sweets, potions, components, etc.).
- Boardgame Tokens: Updated class token sets with refreshed images.
- Removed unused spacemarker asset and reorganized legacy folders.

### New Pages & Utilities (Detailed)
- AutoDM App
  - Quick encounter/scene prompts, treasure hooks, and improv aides; copy-to-clipboard; handbook-themed UI.
- Forest Events Generator
  - Weighted daytime/nighttime tables for hazards, creatures, curios, and travel beats; one-click reroll cycles.
- VR Sim Challenge Hub
  - Central launcher for VR Module challenges; quick-jump links into specific rooms/scenarios; handbook style.
- Game Launcher
  - Unified landing with tiles to open each minigame; light, fast navigation; consistent styling.
- Trinket Generator
  - Procedural trinkets with rarity tags and flavor snippets; generate lists and export to clipboard.
- Image Generator
  - Compose simple tokens/badges from local assets; export WebP/PNG; basic layout and sizing controls.
- Character Creator
  - Form-based builder; outputs a compact summary; saves/restores from local storage.
- Diaper Clicker
  - Idle/clicker prototype with upgrades and soft reset; playful visuals; responsive layout.
- Expeditions
  - Index page for expedition-style modes with brief rules and direct launch links.

- New/Updated Game Entries
  - plainsminibattle.html (+ copy)
    - Quick skirmish on a Plains grid; duplicate copy for sandbox/experimentation.
  - obeliskgaze.html
    - Themed entry page for Obelisk’s Gaze with consolidated instructions/links.
  - magicvortexdefense.html
    - Entry wrapper for Magic Vortex Defense with start modal and controls.
  - expeditionrunner.html (Gravity Runner)
    - Arcade runner entry: obstacles, scoring, and responsive view.
  - runeshift.html
    - Shifting-rune puzzle entry; modern theme and controls.
  - runesliderchallenge.html
    - Runeslider puzzle entry with difficulty/par display and polished layout.

### Diapered Defenders: VR Module (Detailed)
- Visuals & Theme:
  - Adopted handbook parchment/gold palette and typography across panels and controls.
  - Hover cards for monsters/objects: shows stats/traits, with rollable actions when bestiary runtime is loaded.
- Board & Tokens:
  - Dynamic grid sizing favors width; only shrinks to prevent height overflow. Keyboard zoom supported.
  - Player tokens respawn from hard-coded coordinates per room on every entry; no cross-room persistence.
  - Debris tokens render beneath players so defenders can stand on central debris in Malodorous Balance.
- Interactions & Gating:
  - Next-room progression requires: all monsters defeated AND all puzzle/switch requirements met.
  - Scriptorium: crystal “puzzle_switch” must be deactivated; constructs collapse thereafter, and exit becomes available.
  - Trap gas vents log saving throws when stepped on or manually triggered; pit traps can be covered.
- Puzzles & Data:
  - Balance puzzles with button-based selection/placement; instant validation; auto-reset on failure.
  - Supports puzzle definitions at room or layout level.
- Bestiary Integration:
  - Uses runtime bestiary for rich monster cards when running locally; falls back to built-in previews otherwise.

### Old War Defense (Detailed)
- **Towers:**
  - Cleric: 6 unique token images, champion/capstone logic, buff/cleanse/immunity mechanics, new hotkey and UI icon.
  - Animal Fighters: Now use random beast token images, melee-only, larger range, no upgrades.
  - Artillerists: Reduced damage to non-fliers/non-bosses, improved targeting logic.
  - Beastriders/Beast Empress: Reduced damage to airborne, ground AOE no longer hits fliers.
- **Enemies:**
  - All 101 monster sprites mapped to spawn patterns; no unused assets.
  - Empress forms cycle correctly, first two forms 10% slower.
  - Titans, titan beasts, abominations: Move straight, larger size, no zigzag, spawn with delay/offset to prevent clustering.
  - Darkforged horde: Spawns in titan/portal positions, improved spacing.
  - Drill teams, diggers, shadow minions, emergency reinforcements: Special behaviors implemented, unwanted spawns removed.
  - Champion immunities: Curse/disable effects do not affect champions.
- **Portals:**
  - Spawn earlier, more frequently, at more locations, with more enemies as waves progress.
  - Never spawn near the gate; all non-boss, non-digger enemies can exit portals at high levels.
- **Waves:**
  - Endless mode, post-40 fliers, recurring radiant Queen boss with sparkle effects and horde support.
  - Wave details auto-filled in info box at start of each wave.
- **UI/UX:**
  - Essence/lives/wave counters restyled and moved below board.
  - Queue button text never line-breaks.
  - Tower purchase buttons shrunk, more fit on screen.
  - Message log removed; all important messages routed to new wave details box.
  - Token border replaced with glowing underlay; PNG scaling improved.
- **Modes:**
  - Hard Mode: Shorter path, 600 starting essence, UI updates on mode switch.
  - Chaos Mode: Only special enemies, 10k starting essence, unique wave logic.
- **Cheats:**
  - Console toggled with ` and =, supports instant essence, upgrades, wave skips.

### Shifting Rune Maze (Detailed)
- **Visuals:**
  - Black pyramid theme: Gold-glimmering walls, sparkling black tile floors, subtle arcane particles.
  - Elegant serif fonts, gold UI borders, mystical message box.
- **Gameplay:**
  - Maze shifting logic: Random walls/paths change every few seconds, never traps player.
  - Rune Shatter: One-use per level, toggled with space/S, breaks adjacent wall.
  - Level scaling: Maze grows, cell size shrinks, shifting speeds up at key levels.
  - Touch controls: On-screen buttons for mobile, including shatter/reset.
  - Animation loop: Canvas redraws for glimmer/sparkle effects.

