### App-Wide (Granular)
- **Visual Theme:**
  - Unified gold/black/arcane style, consistent font usage, matching borders and glows.
- **Navigation:**
  - Improved minigame switching, responsive layouts, touch support.
- **Handbook/Reference:**
  - Expanded bestiary, item, and race data; new PDFs/HTML docs; improved search and quick-jump.
- **Performance:**
  - Faster load times, optimized assets, improved accessibility and keyboard navigation.
- **Quality of Life:**
  - Standardized message/notification system, tooltips, larger hitboxes, clearer focus states.
- **Content:**
  - New lore, event generators, random tables, boardgame modules, backgrounds, images, and audio assets.

### App-Wide (Ultra-Granular)
- **Infrastructure & Workflow:**
  - Modular file structure: All minigames, handbooks, and assets organized by type for easier maintenance and expansion.
  - Consistent use of Tailwind CSS and Google Fonts for rapid prototyping and visual consistency.
  - All HTML files use meta viewport and mobile-friendly layouts.
  - Versioned changelog and README for tracking updates and onboarding.
- **Accessibility:**
  - All interactive elements (buttons, controls, links) have descriptive ARIA labels and keyboard navigation support.
  - High-contrast color schemes and large font options for visually impaired users.
  - All images and icons have alt text or descriptive labels.
- **Asset Management:**
  - Centralized assets folder for images, audio, fonts, and documents.
  - PNG, SVG, and audio assets optimized for web delivery (compression, scaling, lazy loading).
  - New backgrounds, audio, and font files added for richer minigame and handbook experiences.
- **Developer & UX Improvements:**
  - All scripts and styles separated from HTML for easier updates and debugging.
  - Inline documentation and comments in all major scripts and data files.
  - Consistent naming conventions for all classes, IDs, and data keys.
  - Error handling and fallback logic for missing assets or unsupported browsers.
- **User Experience:**
  - All message boxes, notifications, and tooltips use a unified style and appear in predictable locations.
  - Game state (score, level, settings) persists across reloads where appropriate.
  - All minigames and handbooks are accessible from a single unified menu or dashboard.
  - Quick-jump and search features for all major data tables and handbooks.
  - Print-friendly and PDF export options for handbook/reference content.
- **Localization & Internationalization:**
  - All UI text and messages stored in variables for future translation/localization.
  - Unicode and special character support throughout the app.
- **Testing & Quality Assurance:**
  - Manual and automated testing of all minigames and UI flows.
  - Linting and formatting enforced for all scripts and styles.
  - Regular accessibility audits and user feedback incorporated into updates.
